Armor Statues for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Armor Statues 8.0.6 and Statue Menus by Fuzs.
Original sources:
  https://github.com/Fuzss/armorstatues
  https://github.com/Fuzss/statuemenus
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide (version 0.4.0), and to Sunrise by arismoko (version 0.5.0):
the behaviour is re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). This port
is distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The original assets licences (LICENSE-ASSETS.md, All Rights Reserved) do not apply: this package
carries no textures or icons from either repository, drawing its screen with vanilla GUI sprites
and its own icon.
